title: [BUG] Mem0 Storage metadata limit breach

body (full text, not truncated):

### Description

When trying to user External Memory with Mem0.
The save request can get failed if metadata length is more than 2000 characters.
This is because we are sending assistant message, user message and system prompt in the metadata.

### Steps to Reproduce

Use external memory, and ask to generate a response more than 2000 characters.

### Expected behavior

Should work without an issue.

